.TH "JAWHAR" "2" "Sun Oct 25" "SYSCALL"
.SH NAME
syscall, sys::call, __syscall -- indirect system call
.SH LIBRARY
Standard C Library (libc, -lc)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall.h>
.B #include <unistd.h>
.BI "int syscall(int " number ", ...);"
.fi
.PP
In Rust:
.PP
.nf
.B use sys;
.BI "sys::call(number: u16, ...);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B syscall()
is the function that calls into the kernel.
